    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "Welcome to Urban Outlaw, an action-packed open-world shooter where survival
    is the only rule. In this chaotic city, enemies spawn randomly, and your mission
    is clear\u2014eliminate them all! Armed with a single gun, you'll take on waves
    of enemies while navigating a world filled with cars, a powerful tank, and AI-controlled
    pedestrians.\n\nKey Features:\n\U0001F539 Intense Combat \u2013 Face unpredictable
    enemy spawns and fight to survive.\n\U0001F539 Drive & Dominate \u2013 Take control
    of cars or a tank and switch between driving and shooting with smooth virtual
    camera transitions.\n\U0001F539 Living City \u2013 Cars, pedestrians, and enemies
    follow realistic paths, making the world feel alive.\n\U0001F539 Survival Challenge
    \u2013 With only one gun, every shot counts\u2014take out enemies before they
    take you down!\n\nCan You Rule the Streets?\nWith danger at every turn, Urban
    Outlaw delivers non-stop action. Whether you're driving, shooting, or strategizing,
    your skills will decide if you survive the chaos.\n\nGet ready to own the streets!
    \U0001F697\U0001F52B\U0001F4A5"
